I. SERVICES 
We provide the following services (“Services”) to you: 
A Platform to facilitate the pick-up and drop off of packages from one location to the other 
through services offered by third party drivers or vehicle operators (“Captains”), (“Package 
Services”); 
A Platform to facilitate the booking of two-wheelers (“Bikes”) and avail such transportation 
services provided by the Captains (“Transportation Services”); and 
Other support services (such as associated payment collection) as offered by Torkk from time to 
time. It is hereby clarified that in the State of Karnataka, Torkk acts as a demand generation 
platform for enabling lead generation for Captains, who shall offer Transportation Services 
directly to You. 
 

